{
  "title": "Nice Spicy Tunisian Lamb Tagine",
  "description": "A light and flavorful Tunisian dish featuring lamb, hot chilli powder, and wine, with anti-inflammatory properties. This recipe is easy to make and perfect for a weeknight dinner.",
  "cuisine": "Tunisian",
